sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Patient / Clinician
    participant UI as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant ML as Scikit-Learn Model
    participant KB as Disease DB

    User->>UI: Select Symptoms (e.g. ["skin_rash", "itching"])
    UI->>API: POST /api/predict { symptoms, model_name }
    API->>API: Validate Pydantic Schema & Normalize Keys
    API->>ML: Pass 132-length Binary Feature Array
    ML-->>API: Class Probabilities Array predict_proba()
    API->>API: Rank Top 3 Predictions & Confidence Scores
    API->>KB: Query Disease Metadata (Description, Precautions, Doctor)
    KB-->>API: Return Enriched Clinical Information
    API-->>UI: 200 OK { primary_prediction, top_3, precautions, doctor }
    UI->>User: Display Confidence Gauge, Differential Bars, & Action Steps
